OL,3,ANepalese authorities say 33 UK
OL,4,Anationals missing after flash floods
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK Foreign Office said it is
OL,7,Fworking closely with Nepalese
OL,8,Fauthorities "following concerning
OL,9,Freports of British nationals who are
OL,10,Fmissing" and has encouraged Brits to
OL,11,Ffollow local guidance and "remain alert
OL,12,Fto the changing situation".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
